1424 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I design brands and the products they live inside\056 Those are usually two jobs and two people\054 and doing both is the point\056 Fifteen years across a music library of nearly a million tracks\054 a dog breeder marketplace\054 a real estate brokerage and a care platform for senior living\054 alongside album covers\054 packaging and murals\056 The work underneath is the same each time\072 figure out what the company actually is\054 find the story that makes someone believe it\054 then build the thing that carries it\056 Screens are a commodity now\054 generated on demand\056 Knowing what to say\054 and when someone is ready to hear it\054 is not\056 Based in Los Angeles\054 working across the US and Europe\056)
